@page "/news/fourwinds2026"

<HeadContent>
    <title>Festival of the Four Winds 2026! | Convergence Corp!</title>
    <meta name="description" content="The Festival of the Four Winds is back! See what's new this year!">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://convergencecorp.net/news/fourwinds2026" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Festival of the Four Winds 2026! | Convergence Corp!" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://convergencecorp.net/news/fourwinds2026" />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://convergencecorp.net/images/news/Fourwinds2026/fourwinds2026.png" />
    <meta property="og:image:height" content="200" />
    <meta property="og:image:width" content="250" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="The Festival of the Four Winds is back! See what's new this year!" />
</HeadContent>

<article class="news-article">
    <h1>Festival of the Four Winds 2026!</h1>
    <div>Published: <span class="time">August 11th, 2026</span></div>
    <div>Last Updated: <span class="time">August 11th, 2026</span></div>

    <p>
        The Festival of the Four Winds has returned!
        The festival will be around from <span class="time">August 11th</span> to <span class="time">September 1st</span>.
        Challenge the dangers in The Crown Pavilion of Divinity's Reach or explore the Labyrinthine Cliffs and trade with the Zephyrites of the Zephyr Sanctum.
    </p>
    <section>
        <h2>This years new festival rewards!</h2>
        <p>This year brings some brand new rewards that can be purchased or gotten from achievements.</p>
        <div class="video-container">
            <iframe width="560"
                    height="315"
                    src="https://youtube.com/embed/bo8BhKvnNhI?si=xsiqC1TeesVLgRqy"
                    frameborder="0"
                    allow="accelerometer;encrypted-media;gyroscope;web-share"
                    referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
                    allowfullscreen>
            </iframe>
        </div>
        <h3>Cloud Pteruges!</h3>
        <p>
            This years item for completing all of the Annual achievements, 
            Cloud Pteruges is a leg-armor skin made in the fashion of Ancient Roman and Greek military armor. 
            They also have little clouds floating around.
        </p>
        <p>
            Pair it with last years Cloud Cuirass,
            which is now available at the festival reward vendor for 3 Favors of the Festival and 800 Festival Tokens.
        </p>
        <p>
            You'll also receive a non-cloudy version of the skins.
        </p>
        <h3>New weaponset!</h3>
        <p>
            Spellwork weapons are a remake of the Clockwork weapons with a more magical feel. 
            You can earn 1 weapon by completing 9 of the annual achievements, and 1 each week by completing events in either of the festival maps.
        </p>
        <p>
            Last years Leviathan Bone weapons have been added to the weekly Festival Rewards Vendor. 
            You can purchase 1 each week for 5 Gold and 5000 Festival Tokens.
        </p>
        <h3>New Backpack!</h3>
        <p>
            The Plush Kralky Backpack can be found at the Festival Rewards Vendor for 1 Favor of the Festival and 800 Festival Tokens.
        </p>
        <h3>New Mini!</h3>
        <p>
            Get your Mini Lightning Crystal at the Festival Rewards Vendor for 1 Favor of the Festival and 800 Festival Tokens.
        </p>
        <h3>New Homestead Furniture Recipes!</h3>
        <p>
            Deft Lahar is visiting the Zephyrites in Labyrinthine Cliffs. Talk to him to purchase 5 new recipes for 10 Festival Tokens each.
        </p>
        
        <ul>
            <li>Recipes:</li>
            <li>
                Plush Kralky
            </li>
            <li>
                Canthan Trader Cart
            </li>
            <li>
                Canthan Merchant Canopy
            </li>
            <li>
                Canthan Merchant Stall
            </li>
            <li>
                Canthan Merchant Stall (Open-Backed)
            </li>
        </ul>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h2>Jimothy arrives in Tyria!</h2>
        <p>
            A recent viral e-celebrity from the Seattle area, Jimothy has made his appearance in Lions Arch! 
            Find him and he'll give you a mini version of himself. 
            He will also appear somewhere in your homestead.
        </p>
        <img src=@Assets["/images/news/Fourwinds2026/Jimothy.png"] style="background:grey; width:100%;max-width:400px;" alt="Jimothy"/>
        <p>Fun Fact: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/DayHOfryG7Z/" target="_blank">The original Jimothy footage</a> was captured by the spouse of an ArenaNet employee!</p>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h2>WvW War Score breakdown gets a revamp!</h2>
        <p>
            The Match Statistics page in your WvW menu has a new and improved chart!
            The breakdown makes it easier to see where your points are actually coming from.
        </p>
        <img src=@Assets["/images/news/Fourwinds2026/matchstats.png"] style="width:100%;max-width:600px;"/>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h2>VoE: Code of Creation</h2>
        <p>
            Vision of Eternity's final chapter: Code of Creation 
            will arrive on <span class="time">September 15th, 2026</span>.
        </p>
        <img src=@Assets["/images/news/Fourwinds2026/codeofcreationteaser.jpg"] style="width:100%;" alt="VoE: Code of Creation"/>
        <p>

        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>Challenge Mode (Fractal, Raid, Convergence): <span class="time">September 29th</span></li>
            <li>Legendary Mode (Raid): <span class="time">October 13</span></li>
        </ul>
    </section>
</article>